ognizer,
                            englishRecognizer = paths.englishRecognizer,
                            arabicDictionary = paths.arabicDictionary,
                            englishDictionary = paths.englishDictionary,
                            threads = 4,
                        ),
                    ) { "تعذر تهيئة PaddleOCR على هذا الجهاز" }
                    initialized = true
                }
            }

            fun close() = Unit

            private fun DiagnosticTrace?.fieldsOrEmpty(
                extra: Map<String, Any?> = emptyMap(),
            ): Map<String, Any?> = this?.fields(extra) ?: extra
        }
    ''')

    write(ROOT / "app/src/test/java/com/abdullah/visionbridge/data/ocr/PaddleOcrTextPolicyTest.kt", '''
        package com.abdullah.visionbridge.data.ocr

        import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.CaptureProfile
        import org.junit.Assert.assertEquals
        import org.junit.Assert.assertNull
        import org.junit.Assert.assertTrue
        import org.junit.Test

        class PaddleOcrTextPolicyTest {
            @Test
            fun `Arabic text remains in logical Unicode order with numbers and symbols`() {
                val line = PaddleOcrTextPolicy.accept(
                    PaddleRawLine(
                        box = box(500, 20, 900, 80),
                        arabic = "السعر ١٢٫٥٠ ر.س",
                        arabicScore = 0.94,
                        english = "12.50",
                        englishScore = 0.77,
                    ),
                    1000, 1000, CaptureProfile.STABLE,
                )
                assertEquals("السعر ١٢٫٥٠ ر.س", line?.text)
            }

            @Test
            fun `English candidate wins when it is materially more confident`() {
                val line = PaddleOcrTextPolicy.accept(
                    PaddleRawLine(box(10, 20, 400, 80), "V1sion", 0.86, "VisionBridge 1.12", 0.96),
                    1000, 1000, CaptureProfile.STABLE,
                )
                assertEquals("VisionBridge 1.12", line?.text)
            }

            @Test
            fun `low confidence and replacement characters are rejected`() {
                assertNull(PaddleOcrTextPolicy.accept(
                    PaddleRawLine(box(0, 0, 100, 40), "نص", 0.60, "text", 0.61),
                    100, 100, CaptureProfile.STABLE,
                ))
                assertNull(PaddleOcrTextPolicy.accept(
                    PaddleRawLine(box(0, 0, 100, 40), "نص�", 0.99, "", 0.0),
                    100, 100, CaptureProfile.STABLE,
                ))
            }

            @Test
            fun `Arabic row reads right to left without reversing each string`() {
                val right = accepted("السلام", 0.60, 0.95)
                val left = accepted("عليكم", 0.10, 0.40)
                val ordered = PaddleOcrTextPolicy.readingOrder(listOf(left, right))
                assertEquals(listOf("السلام", "عليكم"), ordered.map { it.text })
            }

            @Test
            fun `fast mode uses stricter confidence`() {
                val raw = PaddleRawLine(box(0, 0, 200, 50), "اختبار", 0.87, "", 0.0)
                assertTrue(PaddleOcrTextPolicy.accept(raw, 200, 100, CaptureProfile.STABLE) != null)
                assertNull(PaddleOcrTextPolicy.accept(raw, 200, 100, CaptureProfile.FAST_TEXT))
            }

            private fun box(left: Int, top: Int, right: Int, bottom: Int) = listOf(
                listOf(left, top), listOf(right, top), listOf(right, bottom), listOf(left, bottom),
            )

            private fun accepted(text: String, left: Double, right: Double) = PaddleAcceptedLine(
                text = text, confidence = 0.95, left = left, top = 0.1, right = right, bottom = 0.2,
                arabicDominant = true,
            )
        }
    ''')


def patch_app() -> None:
    gradle = APP / "build.gradle.kts"
    replace_once(gradle, 'versionCode = 14\n        versionName = "1.11.0"', 'versionCode = 15\n        versionName = "1.12.0"')
    replace_once(gradle, 'android {\n    namespace = "com.abdullah.visionbridge"', 'android {\n    namespace = "com.abdullah.visionbridge"\n    ndkVersion = "27.0.12077973"')
    replace_once(
        gradle,
        '        testInstrumentationRunner = "androidx.test.runner.AndroidJUnitRunner"\n        vectorDrawables.useSupportLibrary = true',
        '        testInstrumentationRunner = "androidx.test.runner.AndroidJUnitRunner"\n'
        '        vectorDrawables.useSupportLibrary = true\n'
        '        externalNativeBuild {\n'
        '            cmake {\n'
        '                cppFlags += "-std=c++17"\n'
        '            }\n'
        '        }',
    )
    replace_once(
        gradle,
        '    buildFeatures {\n        compose = true\n        buildConfig = true\n    }',
        '    buildFeatures {\n        compose = true\n        buildConfig = true\n    }\n\n'
        '    externalNativeBuild {\n'
        '        cmake {\n'
        '            path = file("src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt")\n'
        '            version = "3.22.1"\n'
        '        }\n'
        '    }',
    )
    replace_once(gradle, '    implementation("com.google.mlkit:text-recognition:16.0.1")\n', '')

    settings_model = JAVA / "domain/model/AppSettings.kt"
    replace_once(
        settings_model,
        '    val localOcrEnabled: Boolean = true,',
        '    val localOcrEnabled: Boolean = true,\n    val textRecognitionEngine: TextRecognitionEngine = TextRecognitionEngine.GEMINI_CLOUD,',
    )

    repo_interface = JAVA / "domain/repository/SettingsRepository.kt"
    replace_once(
        repo_interface,
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle',
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle\nimport com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.TextRecognitionEngine',
    )
    replace_once(
        repo_interface,
        '    suspend fun setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled: Boolean)',
        '    suspend fun setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled: Boolean)\n    suspend fun setTextRecognitionEngine(engine: TextRecognitionEngine)',
    )

    settings_repo = JAVA / "data/settings/SettingsRepositoryImpl.kt"
    replace_once(
        settings_repo,
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle',
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle\nimport com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.TextRecognitionEngine',
    )
    replace_once(
        settings_repo,
        '            localOcrEnabled = values[Keys.LOCAL_OCR] ?: true,',
        '            localOcrEnabled = true,\n'
        '            textRecognitionEngine = TextRecognitionEngine.fromStored(values[Keys.TEXT_RECOGNITION_ENGINE]),',
    )
    replace_once(
        settings_repo,
        '    override suspend fun setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled: Boolean) = update(Keys.LOCAL_OCR, enabled)',
        '    override suspend fun setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled: Boolean) = Unit\n'
        '    override suspend fun setTextRecognitionEngine(engine: TextRecognitionEngine) =\n'
        '        update(Keys.TEXT_RECOGNITION_ENGINE, engine.name)',
    )
    replace_once(
        settings_repo,
        '        val LOCAL_OCR = booleanPreferencesKey("local_ocr")',
        '        val LOCAL_OCR = booleanPreferencesKey("local_ocr")\n'
        '        val TEXT_RECOGNITION_ENGINE = stringPreferencesKey("text_recognition_engine_v1")',
    )

    viewmodel = JAVA / "ui/MainViewModel.kt"
    replace_once(
        viewmodel,
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle',
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle\nimport com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.TextRecognitionEngine',
    )
    replace_once(
        viewmodel,
        '    fun setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled: Boolean) = viewModelScope.launch {\n'
        '        container.settingsRepository.setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled)\n'
        '    }',
        '    fun setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled: Boolean) = viewModelScope.launch {\n'
        '        container.settingsRepository.setLocalOcrEnabled(enabled)\n'
        '    }\n\n'
        '    fun setTextRecognitionEngine(engine: TextRecognitionEngine) = viewModelScope.launch {\n'
        '        container.settingsRepository.setTextRecognitionEngine(engine)\n'
        '    }',
    )

    activity = JAVA / "ui/MainActivity.kt"
    replace_once(
        activity,
        '                        onLocalOcrChange = viewModel::setLocalOcrEnabled,',
        '                        onLocalOcrChange = viewModel::setLocalOcrEnabled,\n'
        '                        onTextRecognitionEngineChange = viewModel::setTextRecognitionEngine,',
    )

    screen = JAVA / "ui/MainScreen.kt"
    replace_once(
        screen,
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle',
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle\nimport com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.TextRecognitionEngine',
    )
    replace_once(
        screen,
        '    onLocalOcrChange: (Boolean) -> Unit,',
        '    onLocalOcrChange: (Boolean) -> Unit,\n'
        '    onTextRecognitionEngineChange: (TextRecognitionEngine) -> Unit,',
    )
    old_switch = '''
                AccessibleSwitchRow(
                    title = "OCR محلي سريع للإنجليزية",
                    description = "يقرأ النص اللاتيني على الجهاز فوراً، ويستعين بـGemini للعربية والنص المختلط.",
                    checked = state.settings.localOcrEnabled,
                    onCheckedChange = onLocalOcrChange,
                )
    '''
    new_selector = '''
                if (state.settings.mode == AnalysisMode.TEXT_READING) {
                    SectionTitle("محرك قراءة النص")
                    Row(
                        modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),
                        horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(8.dp),
                    ) {
                        FilterChip(
                            selected = state.settings.textRecognitionEngine == TextRecognitionEngine.GEMINI_CLOUD,
                            onClick = { onTextRecognitionEngineChange(TextRecognitionEngine.GEMINI_CLOUD) },
                            label = { Text("Gemini سحابي") },
                            modifier = Modifier.weight(1f).height(64.dp).semantics {
                                contentDescription = "اختيار القراءة السحابية بواسطة Gemini"
                            },
                        )
                        FilterChip(
                            selected = state.settings.textRecognitionEngine == TextRecognitionEngine.PADDLE_LOCAL,
                            onClick = { onTextRecognitionEngineChange(TextRecognitionEngine.PADDLE_LOCAL) },
                            label = { Text("PaddleOCR محلي") },
                            modifier = Modifier.weight(1f).height(64.dp).semantics {
                                contentDescription = "اختيار قراءة عربية وإنجليزية محلية بالكامل بلا شبكة"
                            },
                        )
                    }
                    Text(
                        if (state.settings.textRecognitionEngine == TextRecognitionEngine.PADDLE_LOCAL) {
                            "يعمل بلا إنترنت وبلا مفتاح. يستخدم PP-OCRv5 العربي والإنجليزي على هاتف ARM64، ويحفظ ترتيب Unicode والرموز ويرفض السطر منخفض الثقة بدلاً من تخمينه."
                        } else {
                            "يستخدم Gemini لقراءة النص. لا يعمل وضع القراءة السحابي من دون مفتاح محفوظ."
                        },
                        style = MaterialTheme.typography.bodyMedium,
                    )
                }
    '''
    replace_once(screen, old_switch.strip("\n"), new_selector.strip("\n"))

    coordinator = JAVA / "capture/FrameAnalysisCoordinator.kt"
    replace_once(
        coordinator,
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle',
        'import com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.SceneDescriptionStyle\nimport com.abdullah.visionbridge.domain.model.TextRecognitionEngine',
    )
    stable_anchor = '''
    ) {
        val keyStarted = SystemClock.elapsedRealtimeNanos()
        val key = apiKeyStore.get()
    '''
    stable_new = '''
    ) {
        if (settings.textRecognitionEngine == TextRecognitionEngine.PADDLE_LOCAL) {
            recognizeLocal(bitmap, settings, generationAtCapture, true, trace)
            DiagnosticHub.record("CLOUD_SKIPPED", trace.fieldsOrEmpty(mapOf("reason" to "paddle_local_mode")))
            return
        }
        val keyStarted = SystemClock.elapsedRealtimeNanos()
        val key = apiKeyStore.get()
    '''
    # Only the first occurrence is processStableText.
    replace_once(coordinator, stable_anchor.strip("\n"), stable_new.strip("\n"))
    fast_anchor = '''
    ) {
        val key = apiKeyStore.get()
        DiagnosticHub.record(
            "API_KEY_LOOKUP_COMPLETED",
    '''
    fast_new = '''
    ) {
        if (settings.textRecognitionEngine == TextRecognitionEngine.PADDLE_LOCAL) {
            recognizeLocal(bitmap, settings, generationAtCapture, true, trace)
            DiagnosticHub.record("CLOUD_SKIPPED", trace.fieldsOrEmpty(mapOf("reason" to "paddle_local_mode")))
            return
        }
        val key = apiKeyStore.get()
        DiagnosticHub.record(
            "API_KEY_LOOKUP_COMPLETED",
    '''
    replace_once(coordinator, fast_anchor.strip("\n"), fast_new.strip("\n"))
    replace_once(
        coordinator,
        '        val outcome = runCatching { localTextRecognizer.recognize(bitmap) }',
        '        val outcome = runCatching { localTextRecognizer.recognize(bitmap, settings.captureProfile) }',
    )

    bridge = JAVA / "data/ocr/InstantLocalOcrBridge.kt"
    bridge_text = bridge.read_text(encoding="utf-8")
    bridge_text = bridge_text.replace("safe on-device Latin OCR", "safe on-device PaddleOCR")
    bridge_text = bridge_text.replace("Only ML Kit Latin output is allowed", "Only verified PaddleOCR output is allowed")
    bridge_text = bridge_text.replace('language = "en"', 'language = if (cleaned.any { it in \'\\u0600\'..\'\\u06FF\' }) "mixed" else "en"')
    bridge_text = bridge_text.replace('"language" to "en"', '"language" to if (cleaned.any { it in \'\\u0600\'..\'\\u06FF\' }) "mixed" else "en"')
    bridge_text = bridge_text.replace('private const val SAFE_LOCAL_SOURCE = "MLKIT_LATIN"', 'private const val SAFE_LOCAL_SOURCE = "PADDLE_OCR_V5"')
    bridge.write_text(bridge_text, encoding="utf-8")

    readme = ROOT / "README.md"
    with readme.open("a", encoding="utf-8") as stream:
        stream.write(textwrap.dedent('''

            ## وضع PaddleOCR المحلي العربي والإنجليزي

            يوفر الإصدار 1.12.0 اختياراً محلياً بالكامل لقراءة النص باستخدام PP-OCRv5 على arm64-v8a.
            يستخدم كاشفاً واحداً ونموذجي تعرف رسميين للعربية والإنجليزية، ولا يستعمل ML Kit أو Tesseract.
            لا يعكس النص العربي يدوياً ولا يصحح الكلمات أو الرموز قاموسياً؛ يحفظ Unicode بترتيبه المنطقي
            ويختار نتيجة كل سطر وفق الثقة ونوع الحروف. السطور منخفضة الثقة تُرفض بدلاً من تخمينها.
            وضع وصف المشهد يبقى سحابياً بواسطة Gemini.
        '''))

    write(ROOT / "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES_PADDLEOCR.md", '''
        # PaddleOCR local mode notices

        VisionBridge bundles arm64-v8a binaries and model assets from the official PaddlePaddle projects:

        - Paddle Lite 2.14rc, Apache License 2.0.
        - PaddleOCR / PP-OCRv5 mobile detection and Arabic/English recognition models, Apache License 2.0.
        - OpenCV Android 4.1.0, Apache License 2.0 / BSD-3-Clause components.

        Upstream source revisions are pinned in `scripts/bootstrap_paddleocr_local.py`. No user image,
        API key or model output is sent to PaddlePaddle by the local engine.
    ''')


def verify_no_other_ocr() -> None:
    gradle = (APP / "build.gradle.kts").read_text(encoding="utf-8").lower()
    forbidden = ["mlkit:text-recognition", "tesseract", "tess-two"]
    found = [item for item in forbidden if item in gradle]
    if found:
        fail(f"forbidden OCR dependencies remain: {found}")
    if not (ASSETS / "arabic_ppocrv5_mobile_rec.nb").exists():
        fail("Arabic PaddleOCR model missing")


def main() -> None:
    hashes = install_upstream()
    install_native_sources()
    install_kotlin()
    patch_app()
    verify_no_other_ocr()
    print(json.dumps({"status": "ok", "assets": hashes}, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))
    shutil.rmtree(TMP, ignore_errors=True)


if __name__ == "__main__":
    main()
